<p>Some questions here:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>remain alive despite the lack of blood flow to or from the object.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>A bit odd, since kidneys are not living per say. Perhaps they can be functional or not decaying, but organs of living things are usually not alive themselves.</p>
<p>Also, when one touches 2380, what happens if one does not know who Østergaard is?</p>

